-- A byte a tag cannot hold is one `invalid` token with unexpected_token,
-- and the tag goes on (frontend.md §9.1): a stray `<`, a number and a `)`
-- in an opening tag (6:12, 6:14, 6:17), a `.` in a closing tag (6:28); the
-- number is one token. The markup is not_implemented at 6:5.
view =
    <div a < 12 ) b>x</div .>
